<view class="page">
  <view class="email-entry">
    <view class="row"><text class="title">完整邮箱日报</text><text class="status">登记中</text></view>
    <view class="description">用量总览、工具／模型占比、输入／输出及缓存明细。<view>先登记邮箱，推送尚未开放。</view></view>
    <button class="email-link" bindtap="goEmail">登记或管理邮箱<text aria-hidden="true">›</text></button>
  </view>
  <view class="intro">微信提醒 · 日报在每天 09:00 发送前一日用量摘要，每次授权预约一条。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">正在读取提醒设置…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="state error">{{error}}<button class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="load">重试</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{!loading && items.length}}">
    <view wx:if="{{!hasReported}}" class="connect"><view>完成电脑接入和首次同步后，可预约提醒。</view><button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="goConnect">接入电脑</button></view>
    <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="key" class="reminder {{focus === item.key ? 'focused' : ''}}">
      <view class="row"><text class="title">{{item.label}}</text><text class="status">{{item.statusText}}</text></view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.key === 'daily'}}" class="description">{{item.timeText}}（北京时间）<view>{{item.dayText}} · 含缓存 Token 总量与调用次数。</view></view>
      <view wx:else class="description">电脑明确报告同步失败，持续至少 15 分钟时提醒一次。<view>电脑休眠、没有新用量、主动停止同步，不发送提醒。</view></view>
      <view wx:if="{{!item.available}}" class="unavailable">开放后可在这里预约。</view>
      <view wx:else class="controls">
        <button wx:if="{{item.appointment.state === 'pending'}}" class="text-button" data-kind="{{item.key}}" bindtap="cancel" disabled="{{busy || savePending}}">取消本次预约</button>
        <button wx:else class="btn btn-primary" data-kind="{{item.key}}" bindtap="subscribe" loading="{{busy === item.key}}" disabled="{{!item.canBook || busy || savePending}}">{{item.appointment ? '再次预约' : '预约提醒'}}</button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice" role="alert">{{notice}}</view>
    <button wx:if="{{savePending}}" class="btn btn-primary retry" bindtap="saveAppointment" disabled="{{busy}}">重试保存预约</button>
    <view class="footnote">微信授权只用于本次提醒，不代表永久订阅。接收通知还需允许微信通知；显示“已提交微信”不代表消息已读。</view>
    <button class="text-button settings" bindtap="openSettings">微信通知设置</button>
  </block>
</view>
<privacy-notice />
